source: crates/deft-cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft subtitle - commands (input -> output)
  info        subtitle -> report    Number of lines, start and end time
  burn        video -> video        Add subtitles: burned into the picture, or --soft
  convert     subtitle -> text      Change format: --to srt|vtt|txt|md
  from-video  video -> srt|vtt      Save an embedded subtitle track: --to srt|vtt
  shift       subtitle -> subtitle  Move all timing: --by 2.5 (later) or --by -1 (earlier)
More: deft subtitle <command> --help
